MTJf1-u_CT5tUKfRK9e0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQUriTQoLWycwhBulQ5gR2P7aH1Ug4oqEC8SXwVJCqibkg&oe=6B0F0354"}, "display_name": "ZOSU Ocean Demo", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Free Demo of \"ZOSU Ocean\"\n- 5 ocean levels to explore (compare to 30 in full game) & 2 lobbies\n- Over 100 sea animals to save, the majority are randomly spawned\n- 10 min timed scoring in demo (60 in full)\n- This is a relaxing game where you are ZOSU the explorer and you are collecting sea creatures to save them from extinction and to score points\n\nControls:\n- Builtin right hand jetpack for movement. Jetpack body movement is set to the direction of your hand.\n- Additional classic movements\n- Score points by collecting fish and finding randomly spawned treasure.\n\nGameplay:\n- Timed scoring mode, 2 minutes per level with over 10 minutes of gameplay in the demo (compare to 60 min in full game)\n- Freeplay mode, no timer and no scoring\n- This is intended to be a relaxing game and there is no way to take damage or die\n- Sea creatures include starfish, dinosaurs, sharks, squid, many common and exotic fish, and large sea mammals\n- Bonus island land lobby with climbing and level selection lobby", "short_description": "Free Demo of \"ZOSU Ocean\" (full game on App)\n- featuring 5 full levels, water lobby, and dry land island lobby\n- (vs 30 levels in full game)\n- Over 100 animals  to save, the majority are randomly spawned\n- 2 min scoring mode per level, or freeplay no timer or scoring mode\n- This is a relaxing game where you are ZOSU the explorer and you are collecting sea creatures to save them from extinction and to score points\n- Controls: built in right hand jetpack for movement"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://zosustudios.wixsite.com/website/about", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://zosustudios.wixsite.com/website/about", "publisher_name": "ZOSU Studios LLC", "support_website_url": null, "